      "description": "Low-emphasis actions such as Undo and Already know.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-quiet\">Undo</button>",
      "css": ".ds-quiet{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:8px;min-height:44px;padding:9px 15px;border:1px solid var(--line-strong,#829384);border-radius:8px;background:transparent;color:var(--ink,#202e27);font:500 .875rem/1.3 var(--font-text,\"DM Sans\",\"Helvetica Neue\",sans-serif);text-align:center;cursor:pointer;transition:background-color 160ms var(--ease,cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1)),border-color 160ms var(--ease,cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1));border-color:transparent;color:var(--muted,#637067)}.ds-quiet:hover{background:var(--paper-sunk,#edf0e8);border-color:var(--ink-2,#46584d)}.ds-quiet:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--focus,#487958);outline-offset:4px;border-radius:4px}.ds-quiet:disabled{opacity:.5;cursor:not-allowed}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-quiet{transition:none}}"
