      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "artist-choice",
      "description": "A flat artist selector with a text marker and selected state.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-artist-choice\" aria-pressed=\"true\"><span class=\"ds-artist-name\">Nina Simone</span><span class=\"ds-artist-mark\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m5 12 4 4L19 6\"/></svg>Picked</span></button>",
      "css": ".ds-artist-choice{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:8px;min-height:44px;padding:9px 15px;border:1px solid var(--line-strong,#829384);border-radius:8px;background:transparent;color:var(--ink,#202e27);font:500 .875rem/1.3 var(--font-text,\"DM Sans\",\"Helvetica Neue\",sans-serif);text-align:center;cursor:pointer;transition:background-color 160ms var(--ease,cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1)),border-color 160ms var(--ease,cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1));display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-start;justify-content:center;gap:7px;min-height:93px;padding:14px 4px;border-width:0 0 1px;border-color:var(--line,#dce2d7);border-radius:0;text-align:left}.ds-artist-choice:hover{background:var(--paper-sunk,#edf0e8);border-color:var(--ink-2,#46584d)}.ds-artist-choice:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--focus,#487958);outline-offset:4px;border-radius:4px}.ds-artist-choice:disabled{opacity:.5;cursor:not-allowed}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-artist-choice{transition:none}}.ds-artist-choice[aria-pressed=true]{color:var(--accent,#315d48);background:var(--pos-wash,#e8f0e4);border-color:var(--line,#dce2d7)}.ds-artist-name{font-size:.9375rem;font-weight:600;line-height:1.3}.ds-artist-mark{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;font-size:.75rem;font-weight:400}.ds-artist-mark svg{width:13px;height:13px;stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:1.7;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round}@media(max-width:650px){.ds-artist-choice{min-height:86px}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Discovery row",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "recommendation-row",
      "description": "A music-first row with familiar connections and a clearly labeled candidate percentile. Illustrative preview content only.",
      "html": "<article class=\"ds-rec\"><div class=\"ds-rec-rank\">01</div><div><h3 class=\"ds-rec-name\">Example artist</h3><p class=\"ds-rec-tags\">Illustrative component preview</p><p class=\"ds-rec-why\">Because of <b>your picked artists</b> in your taste.</p></div><div class=\"ds-percentile\"><b>84</b><span>percentile</span></div></article>",
      "css": ".ds-rec{display:grid;grid-template-columns:32px minmax(0,1fr) 80px;gap:16px;padding:26px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line,#dce2d7);color:var(--ink,#202e27);font:400 1rem/1.55 var(--font-text,\"DM Sans\",\"Helvetica Neue\",sans-serif)}.ds-rec-rank{padding-top:7px;font-size:.8125rem;color:var(--muted,#637067);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}.ds-rec-name{font:500 1.875rem/1.15 var(--font-display,Fraunces,Georgia,serif);letter-spacing:-.025em;margin:0;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.ds-rec-tags{font-size:.75rem;color:var(--muted,#637067);margin:7px 0 12px}.ds-rec-why{font-size:.875rem;color:var(--ink-2,#46584d);margin:0 0 8px}.ds-rec-why b{font-weight:600;color:var(--ink,#202e27)}.ds-percentile{align-self:start;color:var(--sticker-ink,#33543d);background:var(--sticker,#e4ebda);border-radius:8px;padding:10px 12px;text-align:center}.ds-percentile b{font:500 1.4rem/1.1 var(--font-text,\"DM Sans\",\"Helvetica Neue\",sans-serif);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;display:block}.ds-percentile span{font-size:.625rem}@media(max-width:650px){.ds-rec{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) 66px;gap:10px;padding:24px 0}.ds-rec-rank{display:none}.ds-rec-name{font-size:1.625rem}.ds-percentile{padding:9px 6px}.ds-percentile span{font-size:.6875rem}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Evidence disclosure",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "evidence-details",
      "description": "Native disclosure for detailed evidence; the table carries signed effects in text. Illustrative values only.",
      "html": "<details class=\"ds-why\"><summary>Why this match <span>2 supporting signals</span></summary><div class=\"ds-evidence\"><p>Illustrative component preview</p><svg class=\"ds-meter\" width=\"240\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 240 18\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Illustrative evidence: 2 signals for, 0 against, net 0.80\"><rect class=\"ds-track\" x=\"0\" y=\"3\" width=\"240\" height=\"12\" rx=\"4\"/><path class=\"ds-pos\" d=\"M121 3h58v12h-58Z\"/><path class=\"ds-pos\" d=\"M181 3h14q4 0 4 4v4q0 4-4 4h-14Z\"/><line class=\"ds-axis\" x1=\"120\" x2=\"120\" y1=\"0\" y2=\"18\"/><line class=\"ds-net\" x1=\"200\" x2=\"200\" y1=\"0\" y2=\"18\"/></svg><table><thead><tr><th>Signal (standardised)</th><th>Effect</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Similar artists</td><td>+0.60</td></tr><tr><td>Shared taste</td><td>+0.20</td></tr><tr><td>Net score</td><td>+0.80</td></tr></tbody></table></div></details>",
      "css": ".ds-why{font:400 .75rem/1.55 var(--font-text,\"DM Sans\",\"Helvetica Neue\",sans-serif);color:var(--ink-2,#46584d);margin-top:6px}.ds-why summary{min-height:32px;padding:4px 0;cursor:pointer}.ds-why summary:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--focus,#487958);outline-offset:4px;border-radius:4px}.ds-why summary span{margin-left:10px;color:var(--muted,#637067)}.ds-why[open]>summary{margin-bottom:8px}.ds-evidence{max-width:600px;overflow:auto;margin:12px 0 18px}.ds-evidence table{width:100%;min-width:260px;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:.8125rem}.ds-evidence th,.ds-evidence td{padding:12px 14px 12px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line,#dce2d7);text-align:left}.ds-evidence th{font-weight:500;color:var(--muted,#637067)}.ds-evidence td:last-child,.ds-evidence th:last-child{text-align:right}.ds-evidence td:last-child{font:.75rem/1.55 var(--font-mono,ui-monospace,\"SFMono-Regular\",Menlo,monospace);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}@media(max-width:650px){.ds-why summary{min-height:44px}.ds-why summary span{display:none}}.ds-meter{display:block;max-width:100%;height:auto;margin:12px 0 18px}.ds-track{fill:var(--paper-sunk,#edf0e8)}.ds-pos{fill:var(--pos,#347754)}.ds-axis{stroke:var(--line-strong,#829384);stroke-width:1}.ds-net{stroke:var(--ink,#202e27);stroke-width:2}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "The independent listening journal",
    "overview": "Sideband pairs a deep forest navigation rail with a warm, light work surface. Fraunces gives music names and page titles an editorial voice; DM Sans keeps controls, explanations, and dense data direct. Dark mode preserves the same hierarchy for evening listening.\n\nMusic names, familiar connections, and listening actions establish the identity. Thin dividers and tonal areas organize the workspace; photographic artist results appear only when provided by the lookup service. The interface does not invent album artwork. Native controls and compact disclosures keep the product approachable without hiding its evidence.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "A persistent forest rail, with all six destinations retained on mobile.",
      "Editorial music typography paired with plain, compact controls.",
      "Warm tonal surfaces, thin dividers, and restrained floating shadows.",
      "Readable light and dark themes with visible keyboard focus.",
      "Supporting evidence revealed through native disclosures."
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "name": "The Signal Color Rule",
        "body": "Use positive and negative colors for evidence, selection, and feedback states; keep ordinary navigation and primary actions in the accent family.",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Music Voice Rule",
        "body": "Use Fraunces for page titles, discovery artist names, territory headings, and key editorial summaries. Keep form controls and song rows in DM Sans.",
        "section": "typography"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Floating Surface Rule",
        "body": "Keep ordinary sections and recommendation rows flat. Use the shared shadow for content that floats above the workspace: tooltips, toasts, and the mobile discovery action.",
        "section": "elevation"
      }
    ],
    "dos": [
